  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1501.01 “Arm’s length transaction” means a market related transaction between unrelated parties each acting knowledgeably and in their own best interest assuming neither party is under duress.\n\nSource. #2823, eff 8-17-84, EXPIRED 8-17-90\n\nNew. #5334, eff 2-26-92; EXPIRED 2-26-98\n\nNew. #6731, eff 4-18-98, EXPIRES: 4-18-06; ss by #8652, eff 6-6-06; ss by #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
